<th style="text-align: left;"><code>MERGE-SORT(A, p, r)</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="odd">
<td style="text-align: right;">1</td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>if</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?p%20%3C%20r"></td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td style="text-align: right;">2</td>
