  <title>Theoretical Analysis of Insertion Sort</title>
  <link>https://jerryleung16.github.io/my-math-notes/posts/insertion-sort-running-time/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<section id="theoretical-running-time-formulation" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="theoretical-running-time-formulation">1. Theoretical Running Time Formulation</h2>
<p>The running time of the Insertion Sort algorithm is determined by calculating the time spent executing each individual line of pseudocode.</p>
<table class="caption-top table">
